# EmailJS Configuration (Frontend Serverless Email)
# 1. Sign up at https://www.emailjs.com/
# 2. Add an Email Service (e.g. Gmail / Outlook / SMTP for info@hariomdevelopers.in)
# 3. Create an Email Template with subject: "New Property Enquiry - Hariom Developers"
# 4. Paste your credentials below in .env:

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=
